      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "What I think this is, is piles, haemorrhoids. But I can't rule out a small tear, a fissure, as part of the pain.",
